{"version":1,"content":"<p>許靖韻（Angela）日前首度挑戰直播帶貨，即取得亮眼成績，於開播期間已迅速衝上該平台一年一度的Camping榜第三位，其間有品牌甚至將當次直播的庫存售罄，需要於直播尾段緊急返場補貨。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:40:24.459183+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:58:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:18:45.301972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:37:53.466838+00:00","content_hash":"b174b95ed900fa12c2d05412764ea14081843d14fd37a2ea14af76a246e3dab6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}